      "questionType": "single_choice",
      "questionText": " Consider the graph of a power function f, shown below.\n\nWhich one of the following represents the graph f?",
      "imageUrl": "images/M2018_29.png",
      "diagramUrl": "images/M2018_29.png",
      "options": [
        "f(x) = x³⁄₂",
        "f(x) = x⁴⁄₃",
        "f(x) = x²⁄₃",
        "f(x) = x¹⁄₃"
      ],
      "correctAnswerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "Given f(x) = x²⁄₃.\n At x = 8, f(8) = 8²⁄₃ \n\n= (∛8)² = 2² = 4.\n\n At x = -8, f(-8) = (-8)²⁄₃=\n (∛(-8))² =\n (-2)² = 4.\n\n Therefore, the graph passes through the points (8, 4) and (-8, 4).\n\n Hence, option C is correct.",
      "topic": "Mathematics"
    },
    {
