      "correctAnswerIndex": 0,
      "explanation": "[1-x]=3 ⇒\n\n 3≤1-x<4 \n\n⇒ 2≤-x<3\n\n ⇒ -2≥x>-3 \n\n⇒ -3<x≤-2 \n\n⇒ (-3,-2]",
      "topic": "Mathematics"
