      "questionType": "single_choice",
      "questionText": " What is the simplified form of the expression, ((x + 3) / x ÷ (x - 2) / (x - 3)) * ((x² - 2x) / (x² - 9)) over its domain?",
      "options": [
        "(x - 2) / x",
        "(x² - 2) / (x² - 9)",
        "((x - 2)(x + 3)) / (x² - 3x)",
        "1"
      ],
      "correctAnswerIndex": 3,
      "explanation": "((x+3)/x) ÷ ((x-2)/(x-3)) × ((x²-2x)/(x²-9)) \n\n=>  ((x+3)/x) × ((x-3)/(x-2)) × (x(x-2)/((x-3)(x+3))) = 1",
      "topic": "Mathematics"
    },
