        "Its x-intercepts are (-2, 0) and (1, 0), and its y-intercept is (0, 6)."
      ],
      "correctAnswerIndex": 3,
      "explanation": "f(x)=(3x²+3x-6)/(x²-1)\n\n=> 3(x+2)(x-1)/((x-1)(x+1))\n\n=> 3(x+2)/(x+1), x≠±1.\n\n=> x-intercepts: 3(x+2)=0 \n⇒ x=-2 \n⇒ (-2,0).\n\n=> y-intercept: f(0)=(-6)/(-1)=\n6 \n⇒ (0,6).",
